# system.prop — intentionally left empty.
#
# Do NOT set ro.product.* props here globally.
# Per-app device spoofing is handled dynamically by the Zygisk module
# (SysPropHook + Spoofer) on a per-package basis. Setting these globally
# would conflict with the dynamic system and leak spoofed identity to ALL
# apps including banking/wallet apps that must not be spoofed.
